# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# HyperScale Platform — Environment Config
# Copy this file to .env and fill in values
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── General ──────────────────────────────
ENVIRONMENT=development
SERVICE_NAME=hyperscale
LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
DEBUG=true
SECRET_KEY=change-me-to-a-real-secret-key-in-production

# ── MongoDB ──────────────────────────────
MONGODB_URL=mongodb://localhost:27017
MONGODB_DATABASE=hyperscale
MONGODB_MIN_POOL_SIZE=5
MONGODB_MAX_POOL_SIZE=50

# ── Redis ────────────────────────────────
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
REDIS_CACHE_DB=1
REDIS_SESSION_DB=2
REDIS_MAX_CONNECTIONS=50

# ── Apache Kafka ─────────────────────────
KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP_SERVERS=localhost:9092
KAFKA_CONSUMER_GROUP_PREFIX=hyperscale
KAFKA_AUTO_OFFSET_RESET=earliest
KAFKA_ENABLE_IDEMPOTENCE=true

# ── JWT / Auth ───────────────────────────
JWT_SECRET=change-me-to-a-256-bit-secret-key
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=30
JWT_REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRE_DAYS=7

# ── Firebase ─────────────────────────────
FIREBASE_CREDENTIALS_PATH=./firebase-service-account.json
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=hyperscale-platform

# ── gRPC Ports ───────────────────────────
USER_SERVICE_GRPC_HOST=localhost
USER_SERVICE_GRPC_PORT=50051
PRODUCT_SERVICE_GRPC_HOST=localhost
PRODUCT_SERVICE_GRPC_PORT=50052
ORDER_SERVICE_GRPC_HOST=localhost
ORDER_SERVICE_GRPC_PORT=50053
AI_SERVICE_GRPC_HOST=localhost
AI_SERVICE_GRPC_PORT=50054

# ── HTTP Service Ports ───────────────────
USER_SERVICE_PORT=8001
PRODUCT_SERVICE_PORT=8002
ORDER_SERVICE_PORT=8003
NOTIFICATION_SERVICE_PORT=8004
CHAT_SERVICE_PORT=8005
ANALYTICS_SERVICE_PORT=8006
AI_SERVICE_PORT=8007
GATEWAY_PORT=8000

# ── OpenTelemetry ────────────────────────
OTEL_EXPORTER_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:4317
OTEL_SERVICE_NAME=hyperscale
OTEL_TRACES_SAMPLER=parentbased_traceidratio
OTEL_TRACES_SAMPLER_ARG=1.0

# ── Email (SMTP) ────────────────────────
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USERNAME=
SMTP_PASSWORD=
SMTP_USE_TLS=true
EMAIL_FROM_ADDRESS=noreply@hyperscale.dev
EMAIL_FROM_NAME=HyperScale Platform

# ── Twilio SMS ───────────────────────────
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
TWILIO_FROM_NUMBER=

# ── Stripe (Payments) ───────────────────
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# ── Rate Limiting ────────────────────────
RATE_LIMIT_DEFAULT_REQUESTS=100
RATE_LIMIT_DEFAULT_WINDOW_SECONDS=60
RATE_LIMIT_AUTH_REQUESTS=10
RATE_LIMIT_AUTH_WINDOW_SECONDS=300

# ── CORS ─────────────────────────────────
CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:8080
